# Input graph for the `strategie_path` parameter of `visualisation` (see driver.py).
# Holds 2 instance(s) of :Strategie, the class the region's query on g_strategie selects,
# and a neighbourhood that this query must not match: instances of the five
# other tracked classes (so a query wired to the wrong graph, or a file parsed
# into the wrong graph, changes the result), the class reached by another
# predicate than rdf:type, and a same-named class in another namespace.
@prefix : <http://dig.isi.edu/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:strategie_1 a :Strategie .
:strategie_2 a :Strategie .

:tache_in_strategie a :Tache .
:activite_in_strategie a :Activite .
:historique_in_strategie a :Generation .
:phenomene_in_strategie a :Phenomene_Metier .
:domaine_in_strategie a :Domaine .
:strategie_seeAlso rdfs:seeAlso :Strategie .
<http://other.example/strategie_9> a <http://other.example/Strategie> .
